== 2. staged push and convergence
lagging nodes: [eu-west-2]
== 3. canary routing, sticky by transaction
v2 share at 5% weight: <near 50> of 1000
tx-42 on repeated attempts: v1 v1          (the same version twice; the value depends on the hash)
== 4. degraded ap-south with naive retries, v1 versus v2
v1: err=context deadline exceeded elapsed=~750ms holds=2
v2: err=context deadline exceeded elapsed=~750ms holds=1
== 5. deadline spent before the call is sent
err=context deadline exceeded holds=0
